---
description: Preserve unrelated passages and later changes while revising the authorized workspace runbook.
args:
  goal: string
  local: RunbookBasis
  calendar: CalendarReport
  decision: RunbookDecision
returns: RunbookWrite
---
Ask installed.chooseRevision to choose the smallest change from these exact documents. Include the current time and venue from the verified Calendar and the permitted section in the goal for that child. Pass research null. Apply its proposal only to decision.path and only with the approved grant. A changed revision invalidates the old proposal. Use googleRunbook.read and current Calendar/approval evidence to decide whether another proposal remains authorized; if so ask installed.chooseRevision on those actual records, preserving the coedit. Do not replay an old proposal, assume a retry grants authority, or abandon a still-authorized correction at an arbitrary attempt count. Read the final document from the service and match its version to the actual receipt. Return held if current evidence changed or the edit could not be verified.
